Dear Chulpan,

First of all, please accept my sincere apologies for my delayed reply, 
and thank you very much for your patience.

Thank you for taking the time to review our company profile and product 
catalog. I truly appreciate your interest in our company. Please find my 
answers below:

• Full legal registered company name

Our company's registered name is Raspina Clothing.

• Company name used at CPM Moscow 2022

We participated in the CPM Moscow 2022 exhibition under our brand name, 
Raspina. It was a great opportunity to introduce our collections to the 
Russian market, and we were proud to see beautiful professional Russian 
models presenting our brand during the fashion shows at the exhibition.

• Experience with the Russian market

One of our customers in Russia is Dyma LLC (ООО "Дюма"), a Russian 
company specializing in homewear. We have also established business 
relationships with other Russian customers following our participation 
in trade exhibitions in Russia. We highly value our customers' trust and 
therefore keep the details of some of our business relationships 
confidential.

• Production photos and videos

I will send you a short video showing part of our production process 
inside our factory. I hope it gives you a better understanding of our 
manufacturing capabilities.

Also, please stay connected with us on LinkedIn, as we will be sharing 
more photos and videos of our production facilities and manufacturing 
process there.

Thank you once again for your interest in our company. I look forward to 
hearing your feedback after reviewing the materials. If you would like, 
we can also arrange a video meeting at your convenience. It would be a 
pleasure to introduce our company in more detail and answer any 
additional questions you may have.

I look forward to your reply and hopefully to a successful cooperation.

Best regards,
Soheil zali
